
# Public DOM API: userland imports this clean path (never a `native/...` module). Re-exports the `view` handle and the
# abstract native dom API, which the build rewrites to the target platform's impl (browser via @cluesurf/bind, or the
# in-memory server tree) through the native-env mechanism. Frontend code is thus platform-agnostic.

bear @cluesurf/site/code/dom/view
bear @cluesurf/site/code/dom/native/dom
